  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Title: Support to UNHCR&#x2019;s Country Programme for Refugees.The programme aims to support access to protection and basic humanitarian services to an estimated 242,525 Persons of Concern living in the two refugee camps of Nyarugusu and Nduta in the western region of Kigoma, Tanzania. This region borders with their countries of origin &#x2013; Burundi and Democratic Republic of Congo. This support includes provision of health services, nutrition services and clean water</narrative>
  </description>
